- a slack **η₀ > 0**.

Derived exponents:
- **h-floor**: h_*(μ) := max(2ν [Kern], μ − (d − 2)ν [FM level ½], 1 − dμ + ν [window]); h := h_*(μ) + η₀.
- **θ** := (μ − ν) + (μ + h + dν) = 2μ + h + (d − 1)ν. The two summands are the exponents of the rational
  cofactor G(P)/ℓ and of the algebraic value F_A(P).
